# The traits in the body (the traits pass, 2026-10-23; design/TRAITS.md section 5). Every trait the character carries
# is a being he meets and fights in the inner arena (combat/data/traits.mjs). Before the night opens, the trait he is
# about to meet is felt where he sits: in the pad, in his posture, in a sound in the room. When he wakes, what the night
# did to it is felt the same way. The hinge fires these (combat/innerhook.mjs); the shell plays them
# (ui/senseplayer.mjs); the harness keeps them in G.state.cues. No line is written for any of them: the body carries it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- SUSPICION's traits
@sense trait.sum.near
about: PRUDENCE close: the scale's arm in his chest, settling
sound: creak 0.45 near 1.8
caption: an iron arm settling on its stop, somewhere in the house
rumble: 0.3 0.05 260
rumble: 0.3 0.05 260 900
anim: player still 2
camera: push 1.2 1.6

@sense trait.precedent.near
about: LOYALTY close: his father's step in his own boots
sound: knock 0.35 under
sound: knock 0.35 under 0.6
caption: boots in step on the boards, more than one pair
rumble: 0.35 0.05 120
rumble: 0.35 0.05 120 600
anim: player upright 2

@sense trait.smallprint.near
about: COWARDICE close: the urge to be in the next room
sound: murmur 0.3 wall 2
caption: voices through the wall, deciding something without him
rumble: 0.05 0.3 400
anim: player turn 1.5
camera: hold 1

@sense trait.carbon.near
about: GUILT close: the scene back again, as it was
sound: heart 0.5 near 2.4
caption: his own heart, loud
screen: dim 0.25 1.5
anim: player still 2.4
camera: hold 1.6

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- HARDNESS's traits
@sense trait.knees.near
about: WEARINESS close: the chair pulling him down
sound: breath 0.4 near 3
caption: a long breath out, and another
rumble: 0.35 0 900
anim: player slump 3
camera: dip 0.2 1.5

@sense trait.ballast.near
about: OBEDIENCE close: wheels on the road, waiting for his word
sound: cart 0.35 far 3
caption: cart wheels on a frozen road, far off, coming
rumble: 0.2 0.05 1600
anim: player upright 2

@sense trait.pride.near
about: VANITY close: a room that is looking at him
sound: murmur 0.35 near 2
sound: chair 0.3 near
caption: a room of people going quiet as he comes in, a chair pulled out for him
anim: player upright 2
camera: push 1.25 1.4

@sense trait.grip.near
about: APPETITE close: the hands wanting
sound: spoon 0.4 near
caption: a spoon scraping the bottom of a bowl
rumble: 0.45 0.2 140
rumble: 0.45 0.2 140 400
rumble: 0.45 0.2 140 800
anim: player reach 1.5

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- AUTHORITY's traits
@sense trait.condolence.near
about: TENDERNESS close: somebody small leaning on him in the dark
sound: breath 0.25 near 3
caption: a child's breathing, close, slow, asleep against him
rumble: 0.12 0.05 1200
anim: player reach 2

@sense trait.formletter.near
about: CONTEMPT close: the face he puts on for them
sound: snap 0.3 near
caption: a cuff pulled straight
anim: player upright 2
camera: push 1.15 1

@sense trait.chit.near
about: JEALOUSY close: next door's light through the curtain
sound: creak 0.3 wall 1.2
caption: a board creaking on the other side of the fence
anim: player turn 1.6
camera: hold 1.2

@sense trait.hearsay.near
about: SPITE close: a voice saying it before he does
sound: murmur 0.4 wall 2.4
caption: somebody in the next room telling it, and laughing
anim: player flinch 0.6
rumble: 0.05 0.35 180

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- FEAR's traits
@sense trait.smell.near
about: DISGUST close: the smell he cannot get out of his coat
sound: cough 0.35 wall
caption: a cough through the wall, wet
screen: tint #5c6a3e 0.12 2
anim: player flinch 0.8

@sense trait.dark.near
about: DREAD close: something on the stairs
sound: creak 0.4 under 1.2
sound: heart 0.35 near 2
caption: a stair taking a weight, and nobody on it
screen: vignette 0.35 2
rumble: 0.2 0 160
rumble: 0.2 0 160 700
anim: player tremble 2

@sense trait.undertow.near
about: SHAME close: water at his feet that he did not spill
sound: drip 0.4 near 3
caption: water dripping onto the boards, slow
screen: dim 0.2 2
anim: player stoop 2.4

@sense trait.salt.near
about: NERVE close: the moment before he goes first
sound: wind 0.35 far 2
sound: heart 0.4 near 1.4
caption: wind against the shutters, and his heart going hard
rumble: 0.6 0.3 120
anim: player upright 1.4

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- what the night did, felt on waking
@sense trait.cut
about: a trait beaten by force: cut back, the hands still shaking with it, and it will be back
sound: snap 0.5 near
caption: something giving in his hands
rumble: 0.8 0.35 200
anim: player flinch 0.8
camera: dip 0.3 0.6

@sense trait.terms
about: a trait made terms with: it stays, quieter, and it has his ear
sound: breath 0.3 near 2
caption: a slow breath, let go
anim: player still 1.6
hold: 1

@sense trait.taken
about: a trait lost to: it has him now, and it sits heavier than before
sound: heart 0.45 near 2.6
caption: his heart, slow and heavy
screen: vignette 0.3 2.4
rumble: 0.4 0 1400
anim: player slump 2.4
